WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.512 --> 00:00:12.480
If you're getting an updo, never cut the length — just have the ends trimmed lightly,

2
00:00:12.816 --> 00:00:22.968
while if you're keeping short hair, it's best to have the nape line — where it meets the hanbok collar — trimmed neat and short about a week before the ceremony.

3
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:30.528
That way, your hair won't spill over the collar and look messy once you're in your hanbok.
